blurb: The South Portland School Board selected Zeal Education Group to lead its superintendent
  search, emphasizing the firm's comprehensive approach to community engagement and
  commitment to fostering board consensus, despite concerns over its higher cost.
  The decision was made after presentations from three firms and extensive board deliberation.
